flowchart LR
    A[Raw fields] --> B[Handle missing values]
    B --> C[Encode categoricals: one-hot / target]
    C --> D[Scale numerics: standardize / log]
    D --> E[Derive features: ratios, dates, aggregates]
    E --> F[Interactions and binning]
    F --> G[Fit transforms on TRAIN only]
    G --> H[Apply same transforms to val/test]
    H --> I{Leakage check}
    I -- Future info present --> J[Remove leaking feature]
    J --> E
    I -- Clean --> K[Feature set for model]
